A verdict (Q1): RESTATEMENT: every literature a0 and kappa value passes = True; no galaxy-scale quantity enters R (sympy: mass-free, see main).
Q2: a requirement (deposit shape), not a test. Q3: the only falsifiable statement; a rival to (not a consequence of) the framework's flat-a0 law (noted, not scored). Q4: see F.

