=== C: scale-free or circular ===
sympy: R = kappa/(2 pi) * 1/(H0 t) * 1/sqrt(3 Omega_L/8 pi) -> identity True; contains no mass or radius symbol
numerical: kappa=0.5 -> R = 0.2928; cosmology-only factor (per unit kappa) = 0.5855; H0*t0 = 0.9506
d ln R / d ln a0 = 1.000000000
R(t) at fixed a0: t0*0.1: 2.927, t0*1.0: 0.293, t0*10.0: 0.029; the line holds for t in [4.04, 40.4] Gyr
C verdict: SCALE-FREE (mass-independent) and NOT a0-independent

